Cell[BoxData["\<\"box3 is valid basis. The definitions of the basis will be \
saved in \\\"box3dir\\\" directory.\\n    Ds[box3] \[LongDash] \
denominators,\\n    SPs[box3] \[LongDash] scalar products involving loop \
momenta,\\n    LMs[box3] \[LongDash] loop momenta,\\n    EMs[box3] \
\[LongDash] external momenta,\\n    Parameters[box3] \[LongDash] parameters \
(invariants, masses, dimension),\\n    Toj[box3] \[LongDash] rules to \
transform scalar products to denominators,\\n    CutDs[box3] \[LongDash] flag \
